### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Health check at root
GET {{host}}/

### Reuses the given request id (echoed in the X-Request-Id response header)
GET {{host}}/health
X-Request-Id: manual-test-1

### Unknown route: JSON 404 with request id
GET {{host}}/does-not-exist

### CORS: allowed origin gets Access-Control-Allow-Origin
GET {{host}}/health
Origin: {{origin}}

### CORS preflight
OPTIONS {{host}}/health
Origin: {{origin}}
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### CORS: unknown origin gets no Access-Control-Allow-Origin
GET {{host}}/health
Origin: https://evil.example.com
